# Drop host-specific CA bundles here as `<name>.crt`. They're picked
# up by the Sandbox Dockerfile when present and trusted by every
# subsequent build step. The directory is committed with this `.keep`
# so the Dockerfile's COPY always finds at least one entry; the
# `.crt` files themselves are gitignored (.gitignore at the repo
# root). See the comment block in apps/agent/Dockerfile for context.
